  _glyph: "\U0001F412\uFE0F"
  _subtitle: Bound to the Golden Cap
  _description: He and his band must obey whoever owns the [[a0c40bef-c846-429d-9180-278488ee1ae5|Golden
    Cap]], three times each. They serve the [[ff5f930a-90ca-414d-88d2-e61557e01160|Wicked
    Witch of the West]] until [[74be2f99-978f-4a21-9eca-fc675e81362d|Dorothy Gale]]
    wins the Cap.
